# House Hlaalu: Crassius Curio's council work, Vivec (House Brother and up).
# "Banden Indarys" (HH_DestroyIndarysManor): the Redoran lord of the unchartered stronghold killed (10, 100).
# "Dram Bero" (HH_BeroSupport): Crassius (10); Dram Bero in the St. Olms Haunted Manor sets a duel ("Yes." 1: 50);
# entering the Arena Pit brings his champion Garding in (vivecArenaScript), who logs 70 when beaten; Dram pledges
# (100). "Reynel Uvirith" (HH_DestroyTelUvirith; Crassius's "business" offers it at House Father with the
# stronghold's second stage built): the Telvanni sorcerer of Tel Uvirith killed (10, 100).
# PositionCell + `approach` stand in for the travel; the kills and `defend` for the fights.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case hh_destroy_indarys
approach 059264AE
talk crassius curio
ask business
ask Banden Indarys
expect GetJournalIndex HH_DestroyIndarysManor == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell 139 -801 -1260 0 "Indarys Manor"
until 300 GetPCCell "Indarys Manor" == 1
approach 05481A45
console 05481A45.kill
wait 60
run
player->PositionCell 492 -116 -491 0 "Vivec, Curio Manor"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Curio Manor" == 1
approach 059264AE
talk crassius curio
ask Banden Indarys
expect GetJournalIndex HH_DestroyIndarysManor == 100
bye
end

case hh_bero_support
approach 059264AE
talk crassius curio
ask business
ask Dram Bero
expect GetJournalIndex HH_BeroSupport == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell 7129 501 -501 0 "Vivec, St. Olms Haunted Manor"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, St. Olms Haunted Manor" == 1
approach 05A264FA
talk dram bero
ask support on the Council
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex HH_BeroSupport == 50
bye
defend
run
player->PositionCell 0 -400 -325 0 "Vivec, Arena Pit"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Arena Pit" == 1
until 1200 GetJournalIndex HH_BeroSupport >= 70
run
player->PositionCell 7129 501 -501 0 "Vivec, St. Olms Haunted Manor"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, St. Olms Haunted Manor" == 1
approach 05A264FA
talk dram bero
ask support on the Council
expect GetJournalIndex HH_BeroSupport == 100
bye
end

case hh_destroy_uvirith
run
player->PositionCell 492 -116 -491 0 "Vivec, Curio Manor"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Curio Manor" == 1
approach 059264AE
talk crassius curio
ask business
ask Reynel Uvirith
expect GetJournalIndex HH_DestroyTelUvirith == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell 175 -92 25 0 "Tel Uvirith, Tower Lower"
until 300 GetPCCell "Tel Uvirith, Tower Lower" == 1
approach 05A411B1
console 05A411B1.kill
wait 60
run
player->PositionCell 492 -116 -491 0 "Vivec, Curio Manor"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Curio Manor" == 1
approach 059264AE
talk crassius curio
ask Reynel Uvirith
expect GetJournalIndex HH_DestroyTelUvirith == 100
bye
end
